    {
      "id": "13374",
      "body": "User:712020:a070aeb5-3811-46ca-b323-e2272f4cd929 I asked Dani and generally the max number of colours would be 7. Mostly for shoes / bags it’s relevant to have colour selector.\nCC: User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
