      "body": "User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac User:712020:08a6f120-c836-4f71-92db-c97999401c49  \n\nThis cannot yet be tested: \n\n- New Style Code: Given a shopper clicks a colour swatch, when the selection is registered, then the URL updates to reflect the selected colour with a new style code and a full page reload.\n\nWe need a product attribute for this in BM. \nI’ll create a story for that now. \n\nCC: User:557058:1a7fb05a-783b-4241-a0f1-9a7b046da3a8",
