      "body": "User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac  User:712020:4ec4770e-9470-4885-9753-69a36b6cf950 I removed this ac from this ticket: \n\n- New Style Code: Given a shopper clicks a colour swatch, when the selection is registered, then the URL updates to reflect the selected colour with a new style code and a full page reload.\n\nThis requires more build - we will cover this AC in [SFCC-708](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-708)",
      "author": {
